{"unit_id":"ninetyhe-90__dsh-assistant-stream#card-zh","repo":"ninetyhe-90/dsh-assistant-stream","commit":"d423b5bcae8aee92d5ee06abbad057099292a5ad","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-assistant-stream（DSH 插件，通用客户端）：将会话助手流导出为逐行 JSON，供外部程序实时读取。它监听助手流与会话事件，输出文本和推理增量、完成块、已提交消息、尝试结束、轮次边界及工具调用和结果的顺序标记。每行包含会话、请求、轮次、尝试和序号，便于消费端重建回答。默认写入 stderr，也可配置自定义 sink；子代理会话不导出。适合网关、桌面端和调试程序消费或记录流式回答。需要 Node.js 20.11+；可选设置 DSH_TURN_ID，无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/assistant-stream.mjs:13-40","src/assistant-stream.mjs:67-107"]}
{"unit_id":"ninetyhe-90__dsh-assistant-stream#card-en","repo":"ninetyhe-90/dsh-assistant-stream","commit":"d423b5bcae8aee92d5ee06abbad057099292a5ad","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-assistant-stream exports DSH assistant events as NDJSON, including text and reasoning deltas, commits, turn boundaries, and ordered tool markers. It writes to stderr or a custom sink and filters subagents. Gateways can consume the stream live. Requires Node.js 20.11+.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/assistant-stream.mjs:13-40","src/assistant-stream.mjs:67-107"]}
